      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found a similer problem.\nWhen a UdonBehaviour component has attached to Panel, blue beam will disappears around left end of the panel.\nI guessed it happenes with Image component, but it wasn't happened when UdonBehaviour component attached to Button.\nBeam disappearing looks like some collider blocked it.\nJust like Canvas's issue.\nThis is reproductive in the world I posted above.",
      "viewerReactions": null
